/span> 的拼接由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a> 的显式重载解释。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\land\n\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\,\\exists A\\in V\\,\\exists\\gamma\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\n\\bigl((A,\\gamma)\\in P\\land\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\land\n\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\,\\exists A\\in V\\,\\exists\\gamma\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\n\\bigl((A,\\gamma)\\in P\\land\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\nD_G\\coloneqq\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^2:\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G\\beta\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\nD_G\\coloneqq\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^2:\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G\\beta\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G^*\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}(D_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G^*\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}(D_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every variable in the replacement clause is locally typed; zero production steps are included by the reflexive closure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}$ (reflexive transitive closure, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothes